    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.p.water-wood-fire-earth-and-metal": "Wai, Lāʻau, Ahi, Honua, a me Metala — hoʻopaʻa kēlā me kēia māhele o kāu pou totem i kahi holoholona me kekahi o kēia mau ʻElima Mea, e hoʻohui ana i ke ʻano i kāu mau alakaʻi ʻUhane, Noʻonoʻo, Naʻau, a me Kino.",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.btn.read-more.2": "Heluhelu hou aku",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.h3.yin-yang": "Yin & Yang",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.p.each-totem-animal-carries-fixed-polarity": "Lawe kēlā me kēia holoholona totem i ka polarity paʻa mai ka hoʻomaka — ʻIole lāʻau mau Yang, Pipi hihiu mau Yin, Tiger mau Yang, Pōpoki mau Yin, a pēlā aku.",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.btn.read-more.3": "Heluhelu hou aku",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.h3.values-triangles": "Nā Huinakolu Waiwai",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.p.four-core-values-organize-the-twelve": "Hoʻonohonoho nā waiwai kumu ʻehā i nā holoholona he ʻumikūmālua i nā huinakolu e wehewehe i ka mea a kēlā me kēia alakaʻi e mālama nui ai.",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.btn.read-more.4": "Heluhelu hou aku",
