    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.p.within-each-values-triangle-the-three": "I loko o kēlā me kēia Huinakolu Waiwai, pāʻani nā holoholona ʻekolu i kekahi o nā Kuleana Kapu ʻekolu: ke ʻImi, ke Kahuna, a i ʻole ke Aliʻi — ʻekolu ala like ʻole e hōʻike ai i ka waiwai kumu o ia huinakolu.",
