    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.p.a-simple-timezone-shift-to-nepal": "He hoʻololi timezone maʻalahi i ka Manawa Nepal (NPT) ma mua o ka helu ʻana — he heleuma intuitive no ka heluhelu ʻana i nā kia lā a me hola.",
