    "home.p.untangle-the-complexities-of-life-in": "E wehe i nā paʻakikī o ke ola ma kēia ao hou digital ma ka hoʻohui hou ʻana me ke akeakamai kahiko o nā totem holoholona ʻehā kūʻokoʻa āu i hānau ʻia ai",
