    "home.h3.new-connections": "Nā Pilina Hou",
    "home.p.find-the-people-and-opportunities-that": "E ʻimi i nā kānaka a me nā manawa kūpono e kūlike me kāu mau alakaʻi — nā hoaaloha, ke kaiāulu, a me nā hoʻomaka hou.",
    "home.h3.totem-connections-directory": "Papa Kuhikuhi Totem Connections",
    "home.p.opt-in-with-your-four-totem": "E koho komo me kāu mau holoholona totem ʻehā a e nānā i nā poʻe ʻē aʻe ma ka database lehulehu — i hoʻopaʻa ʻia e nā pilina Rainbow, Shadow, Trine, a i ʻole Mirror.",
