    "home.p.discover-your-four-totem-animal-guides": "E ʻike i kāu mau alakaʻi holoholona totem ʻehā me ka manuahi — ʻUhane, Noʻonoʻo, Naʻau, a me Kino — mai kāu lā, manawa, a me kūlanakauhale hānau.",
