    "home.faq.p.animal-names-birth-times-compatibility-a": "Nā inoa holoholona, nā manawa hānau, ka compatibility, a me ke kumu e ʻike ʻokoʻa ai nā holoholona like i nā kānaka ʻelua.",
    "home.faq.btn.read-the-faq": "Heluhelu i ka FAQ",
    "home.h2.ready-to-begin": "Mākaukau e hoʻomaka?",
    "home.p.whether-you-re-new-to-astrology": "Inā he hou ʻoe i ka astrology a i ʻole e hoʻohohonu ana i kahi hana i loaʻa, ʻo kāu ʻanuʻu mua he kamaʻilio.",
    "home.btn.schedule-your-session": "E Hoʻonohonoho i kāu Kau",
    "page.about.p.from-the-four-pillars-of-destiny": "Mai ka Four Pillars of Destiny a hiki i kahi timezone Nepalese — ka moʻolelo o ke ʻano i ʻike ai ʻo Totem Astrology i kona wahi.",
    "page.about.h2.travis-barrett-leblanc": "Travis Barrett LeBlanc",
    "page.about.p.relationship-counselor-multi-system-astr": "Kākāʻōlelo Pilina, Astrologer Multi-System, a me ka mea nāna i hana pilikino iā Totem Astrology",
    "page.about.p.i-developed-totem-astrology-over-the": "Ua hoʻomohala au i ka Totem Astrology i nā makahiki i hala iho nei ma o ka huakaʻi ʻana i ka honua, kamaʻilio pū me nā tausani o nā kānaka like ʻole, a me ke aʻo ʻana i nā ʻōnaehana hōkū like ʻole. Ua loaʻa iaʻu ke kumu koʻikoʻi ma ka moʻomeheu Kina Four Pillars of Destiny - ʻoiai ua hoʻohana kekahi i kēia mea hana no ka helu ʻana i nā pōmaikaʻi a me nā hopena, ua haʻi mai koʻu intuition iaʻu he mea hou aʻe ia e aʻo mai ai iā mākou e pili ana i ke kumu o kā mākou hana ʻana i loko.",
    "page.about.p.my-first-clue-was-the-four": "ʻO kaʻu ʻike mua ʻo ia nā ʻāpana ʻehā: ka Makahiki, Mahina, Lā, a me ka hola. Pono kēia mau mea e like me ko mākou ʻuhane, noʻonoʻo, naʻau, a me ke kino! Ua hana au i ka helu ʻana, akā aia kekahi mea. Ua like ka hapa o luna o ka ʻike me ka makahiki a me ka mahina, akā ʻo ka hapa lalo me ka lā a me ka hola ʻaʻole like me ka laina me nā ʻike o ka poʻe e kū pono ana i mua oʻu. Ua hoʻopaʻa wau me ia no nā makahiki ma mua o ka ʻike ʻana mai iaʻu: ʻO ka ʻEhā Pillars System ke koi nei i kona kuleana hānau mai ka Jade Emperor, ma kekahi mau kuʻuna i hāʻawi pololei ʻia mai ka Buddha ponoʻī.",
    "page.about.p.since-the-buddha-s-traditional-birthplac": "No ka mea aia ma Nepal ka wahi hānau kuʻuna o Buddha, ua hoʻoholo wau e hoʻomaka i ka hoʻololi ʻana i nā manawa hānau o nā poʻe i ka palena manawa Nepalese ma mua o ka hoʻohui ʻana i kā lākou ʻike i ka ʻEhā Pillars Calculator - a hiki koke, voilà! Hoʻopili hope kēia ʻikepili hānau hou i nā mea a pau. No laila, i kēia manawa ma kā mākou pūnaewele, hana ka <a href=\"calculator.html\">Totem Calculator</a> i nā mea a pau iā ʻoe: e hoʻopili wale i kou lā hānau, manawa, a me kou wahi, a ua hoʻokomo ʻia ka hoʻololi ma mua o ka puka ʻana o kāu mau holoholona ʻehā. ʻĀnō, ʻo ka mea āu e ʻike ai e pili pono ana me kou ʻuhane, noʻonoʻo, naʻau, a me ke kino!",
    "page.about.h3.philosophy": "Filosofia",
    "page.about.p.i-like-to-think-of-these": "Makemake au e noʻonoʻo i kēia mau holoholona ʻehā e like me nā kāleka i hāʻawi ʻia iā ʻoe i ka hoʻomaka ʻana o kēia ola. Ua kūkulu ʻia lākou ma laila mai ka hoʻomaka ʻana e pono ai ʻoe, akā ʻaʻole lākou e sila iki i kou hopena. Loaʻa iā ʻoe ka manawa kūpono e hana ai iā lākou a hoʻomaʻemaʻe iā lākou, a i ʻole e mālama ʻole iā lākou a bluff i kekahi manawa inā makemake ʻoe! Akā, he mea kōkua ia e ʻike i kāu mea e pāʻani nei no ka mea ke neʻe nei ka pāʻani.",
    "page.about.p.a-central-tenet-of-totem-astrology": "ʻO ka manaʻo koʻikoʻi o Totem Astrology ka manaʻolana - manaʻolana no ka hoʻomaopopo maikaʻi ʻana iā ʻoe iho, manaʻolana e hoʻomaopopo maikaʻi i kāu mau hoa pili a me nā lālā o ka ʻohana, a me ka manaʻolana aia kekahi, a i ʻole kekahi, ma waho e kūlike me ʻoe e like me kou ʻano. Hāʻawi nā alakaʻi ʻehā iā mākou i kahi ʻano ʻōlelo kaʻana like: kahi mea ʻokoʻa e hōʻailona i ka mea e hana nei no mākou i loko, no laila hiki iā mākou ke kamaʻilio e pili ana i kā mākou ʻokoʻa me ka ʻole o kēlā me kēia kamaʻilio e lilo i hoʻokolokolo.",
    "page.about.p.this-is-not-an-excuse-for": "ʻAʻole kēia he kumu no ka hana ʻino, ʻaʻole hoʻi he kumu e ʻae ai i ka hana ʻino a kekahi. He mea hana ia no ka hoʻomaopopo ʻana i kekahi i kekahi a hāʻawi i kekahi i kekahi i ka lokomaikaʻi - ka lokomaikaʻi i hānau ʻia mai ka hoʻomaopopo ʻana i ko mākou ʻokoʻa a me ka mahalo i nā ʻano ʻano like ʻole o ka poʻe e hana ai i loko. Ke ʻike mākou i ka hiki ʻana mai o ka lohi o ka mea aloha i hui pū ʻia me ka noʻonoʻo moeʻuhane a ka Cat a i ʻole ka Deer, a i ʻole ka mākaukau o ka Tiga a Lio paha e hoʻomaka i ka hana, e loaʻa iā mākou nā puka makani i nā mea e hiki mai ana i loko - mau me ka pahuhopu o ka hoʻoponopono ʻana i ko mākou mau hemahema o loko a me ka lokomaikaʻi i nā hemahema o kekahi, ʻaʻole e kala i ka pōʻino.",
    "page.about.p.everybody-else-has-their-own-four": "Loaʻa i nā kānaka ʻē aʻe kā lākou mau holoholona ponoʻī ʻehā, a hiki ke kōkua i ka ʻike i ka mea a mākou e hana nei i hiki iā mākou ke hoʻomaopopo maikaʻi kekahi i kekahi a hauʻoli i kā mākou ʻokoʻa ma mua o ka hakakā ʻana ma luna o lākou. He ʻokoʻa ka ikaika o nā holoholona like ʻole a lawe kēlā me kēia totem i kona akamai ponoʻī.",
    "page.about.section-label.the-system": "Ka ʻŌnaehana",
    "page.about.h2.spirit-mind-heart-body": "ʻUhane, Noʻonoʻo, Naʻau & Kino",
    "page.about.p.each-pillar-of-your-totem-pole": "Hōʻike kēlā me kēia pou o kāu pou totem i hoʻokahi alakaʻi holoholona totem - he hōʻailona ola no kēlā ʻāpana o ʻoe.",
    "page.about.h3.year-spirit": "Makahiki · ʻUhane",
