    "page.about.h3.hour-body": "Hola · Kino",
    "page.about.p.this-animal-speaks-to-us-through": "Ke kamaʻilio nei kēia holoholona iā mākou ma o ka ʻōlelo o ka instinct.",
    "page.about.btn.reveal-your-four-guides": "E hōʻike i kāu mau alakaʻi ʻehā",
