    "page.conn.p.each-person-has-four-totem-animals.2": "Loaʻa i kēlā me kēia kanaka nā holoholona totem ʻehā - ʻuhane, noʻonoʻo, naʻau, a me ke kino. Hoʻohālikelike mākou i ka pou like ma waena o ʻelua mau kānaka a helu ʻelima mau ʻano pili.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.label.i-agree-to-list-my-display.2": "ʻAe wau e hoʻopaʻa inoa i koʻu inoa hōʻike, ʻehā mau holoholona totem, kahi koho, intro, a me ka leka uila koho ma kēia papa kuhikuhi lehulehu ma hope o ka loiloi.",
