    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one": "ʻO nā hoa ʻo Yin a me Yang - hoʻopuka kēlā me kēia i nā kala maoli o kekahi holoholona e like me ka prisma, no laila ka huaʻōlelo \"Rainbow.\" ʻO kahi hui like ʻole e mahalo nui ʻia i kēlā me kēia manawa āu e ʻike ai.",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one.2": "Nā hoa ʻo Yin a me Yang — Hoʻopuka kēlā me kēia i nā kala maoli o kekahi holoholona e like me ka prisma, no laila ka huaʻōlelo \"Rainbow\" - me kēia ʻano pilina, ʻike maoli ʻoe i kekahi i kekahi! He paʻa kakaʻikahi ia, a pono e mahalo ʻia i kēlā me kēia manawa āu e ʻike ai! Pono ka hana pono'ī ma mua o ka mākaukau ʻana o ka hapa nui o nā kānaka no kēia ʻano pilina - ma hope o nā mea a pau, e hōʻike ʻia ke kiko piha o kou mau kala maoli i ka manawa holoʻokoʻa, no laila e ʻoi aku ka maikaʻi o ka hoʻomaʻamaʻa ʻana i kou mau hiʻohiʻona a pau i poli a ʻālohilohi!",
