    "page.connType.shadow.p.a-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-pairing": "ʻO kahi hui Yin-Yang pōʻeleʻele e hōʻike ana i nā huna huna o kēlā me kēia - e hōʻike ana i ka mea i hūnā ʻia, inā makemake ʻoe a ʻaʻole paha.",
    "page.connType.shadow.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.shadow.p.this-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-animal": "Hōʻike kēia hui holoholona Yin-Yang ʻeleʻele i nā ʻōpū huna o kēlā me kēia - e hōʻike ana i ka mea e hūnā ʻia, inā makemake ʻoe a ʻaʻole paha! He hui maikaʻi loa ia no ka hana karmic, e kōkua ana iā ʻoe e ulu aʻe ma o ka hoʻomau ʻana i ka paʻa a ʻike i ka mea e hana pū ai. Ua ʻike au i ka nui o nā kāne aloha, ʻo nā kāne a me nā wahine i male hauʻoli no nā makahiki, akā ua ʻike maʻalahi wau i ka hōʻike ʻia ʻana i nā hui haumāna-kumu a makua-keiki, kahi i hoʻomaka ai ka manaʻo e hana i kāu mau hewa a hoʻomaikaʻi iā ʻoe iho i ke ʻano o ka pilina.",
