    "page.connType.values-trine.section-label.connection-type": "ʻAno Pilina",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h1.values-trine": "Values Trine",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Waiwai kaʻana like — aia nā holoholona ʻelua i ka Triangle Values ​​hoʻokahi, no laila ʻōlelo pinepine ʻoe i ka ʻōlelo like i ka wā e pili ana i nā mea nui o ke ola.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Waiwai kaʻana like - aia nā holoholona ʻelua i ka Triangle Values ​​like: Power & Prestige, Security & Stability, Inspiration & Idealism, a i ʻole Peace & Harmony. ʻO kēia mau pilina ka poʻe e ʻōlelo i ka ʻōlelo like me ʻoe, nā waiwai-wise. Loaʻa iā lākou nā mea nui e pili ana i ke ʻano o ka hele ʻana e pili ana i ke ola - inā paha ʻo ia ka ʻimi ʻana i ka mana a me ka hana hana i kahi kālepa, a i ʻole ka ʻimi ʻana i ka maluhia a me ke ʻano maʻalahi. He poʻe kēia ʻaʻole pono ʻoe e wehewehe pinepine iā ʻoe iho, no ka mea aia lākou ma ka ʻaoʻao like me ʻoe, no laila hiki ke maikaʻi no kēlā me kēia ʻano pilina: ʻoihana a leʻaleʻa paha, ʻohana a i ʻole hoaloha. Ka holo mālie :)",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h3.other-connection-types": "Nā ʻano pilina ʻē aʻe",
