    "page.connType.values-trine.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "E helu i kāu mau holoholona totem ʻehā, a laila e nānā i ka papa kuhikuhi koho no ka poʻe e kaʻana like i kēia ʻano pili me ʻoe.",
