    "home.h2.a-revolution-in-how-we-understand": "He Hurihanga i te Āhua e Mārama ai Tātou ki ō Tātou Whanaungatanga ki Ētahi Atu me ngā Wāhanga Taupatupatu o roto i a Tātou",
    "home.p.untangle-the-complexities-of-life-in": "Wetewetehia ngā uauatanga o te ora i tēnei ao hou, digital mā te hono anō ki te mātauranga tawhito o ngā totem kararehe e whā motuhake i whānau mai koe",
    "home.h3.personal-reading": "Pānui Whaiaro",
    "home.p.meet-your-four-totem-guides-and": "Tūtaki ki ō kaiārahi totem e whā ka kitea ngā pūmanawa o roto i whānau mai koe hei tohatoha.",
    "home.h3.relationship-guide": "Aratohu Whanaungatanga",
    "home.p.understand-the-totem-dynamics-between-yo": "Mārama ki ngā dynamika totem i waenga i a koe me tētahi hoa — te kūtoni, te pākaha, me te kaupapa tūhono.",
    "home.h3.family-dynamics": "Ngā Dynamika Whānau",
    "home.p.map-totem-patterns-across-your-family": "Maherehia ngā tauira totem puta noa i tō whānau hei whakaora i ngā porowhita tawhito me te whakakaha i te hononga.",
    "home.h3.business-goals": "Ngā Whāinga Pakihi",
