    "home.p.find-the-people-and-opportunities-that": "Kimihia ngā tāngata me ngā āheinga e ōrite ana ki ō kaiārahi — ngā hoa, te hapori, me ngā tīmatanga hou.",
    "home.h3.totem-connections-directory": "Rārangi Totem Connections",
    "home.p.opt-in-with-your-four-totem": "Tīpako kia uru me ō kararehe totem e whā ka tirotiro i ētahi atu i te pātengi tūmatanui — e ōrite ana mā ngā hononga Rainbow, Shadow, Trine, Mirror rānei.",
    "home.h3.totem-animals-calculator": "Totem Animals Calculator",
    "home.p.discover-your-four-totem-animal-guides": "Kimihia ō kaiārahi kararehe totem e whā mō te kore utu — Wairua, Hinengaro, Ngākau, me Tinana — mai tō rā, wā, me te tāone whānau.",
