    "home.h3.business-goals": "Te mau fānaʻoraʻa ʻōhipa",
    "home.p.align-your-work-and-ambitions-with": "A faaau i to ʻoe ʻōhipa e te mau fānaʻoraʻa e to ʻoe mau mana totem e te taime e tauturu ia rātou.",
    "home.h3.new-connections": "Te mau fāriʻiraʻa āpi",
    "home.p.find-the-people-and-opportunities-that": "A imi i te taata e te mau fānaʻoraʻa e au i to ʻoe mau aratai — te mau hoa, te nūnaʻa, e te haamataraʻa āpi.",
    "home.h3.totem-connections-directory": "Lita Totem Connections",
    "home.p.opt-in-with-your-four-totem": "A maiti no te tomo ma to ʻoe e maha animala totem e a hiʻo i te tahi atu i te database no te taata atoa — te faaauhia e te mau fāriʻiraʻa Rainbow, Shadow, Trine, aore ra Mirror.",
    "home.h3.totem-animals-calculator": "Totem Animals Calculator",
    "home.p.discover-your-four-totem-animal-guides": "A ite i to ʻoe e maha aratai animala totem maoriʻi — Vārua, Manaʻo, ʻĀʻau, e te Tino — mai to ʻoe mahana, taime, e te ʻoire fanau.",
    "home.section-label.book-a-session": "A tāpaʻo i te hoê taime",
    "home.h2.your-reading-step-by-step": "To ʻoe taiʻoraʻa, tātaʻitahi",
    "home.p.every-session-follows-a-clear-comfortabl": "Te haere nei te taime tātaʻitahi i te hoê huru maʻaʻa e te au mai te parau mua e tae noaʻtu i te haapaʻoraʻa.",
    "home.h3.reach-out": "A parau mai",
    "home.p.choose-a-service-and-send-a": "A maiti i te hoê raveʻa e a pūpū i te hoê parau ma to ʻoe mahana, taime, e te vāhi fanau ia vai ia ʻoe.",
    "home.h3.schedule": "Taime",
    "home.p.we-ll-confirm-details-and-book": "E faaʻite mātou i te mau taʻaʻē e a tāpaʻo i te hoê taime vitiō i te taime e au ia ʻoe.",
    "home.h3.your-session": "To ʻoe taime",
    "home.p.a-focused-conversational-reading-tailore": "Hoê taiʻoraʻa paraparau i faataahia i to ʻoe mau uira — ua haapaʻohia no ʻoe no te hiʻo faahou.",
    "home.h3.integration": "Faʻaʻohipa",
    "home.p.receive-a-written-summary-and-optional": "E farii oe i te hoê haʻapotoraʻa i pāpaʻihia e te haapaʻoraʻa i maiti no te faahohonu i to ʻoe ʻite i te taime.",
