    "home.p.whether-you-re-new-to-astrology": "Ia āpi oe i te astrology aore ra e faahohonu ana i te hoê faʻaʻohiparaʻa, to ʻoe haamataraʻa mua e te paraparau.",
    "home.btn.schedule-your-session": "A tāpaʻo i to ʻoe taime",
    "page.about.p.from-the-four-pillars-of-destiny": "Mai te Four Pillars of Destiny e tae noaʻtu i te timezone Nepalese — te aamu o te huru i papu ai te Totem Astrology.",
    "page.about.h2.travis-barrett-leblanc": "Travis Barrett LeBlanc",
    "page.about.p.relationship-counselor-multi-system-astr": "Te taata faaʻite fāriʻiraʻa, te Astrologer Multi-System, e te Taata i hamani i te Totem Astrology",
    "page.about.p.i-developed-totem-astrology-over-the": "Ua hoʻomohala au i ka Totem Astrology i te mau matahiti i hala iho nei ma o ka huakaʻi ʻana i ka honua, kamaʻilio pū me te mau tausani o te mau taata like ʻole, a me ke aʻo ʻana i te mau ʻōnaehana hōkū like ʻole. Ua loaʻa iaʻu ke kumu koʻikoʻi ma ka moʻomeheu Kina Four Pillars of Destiny - ʻoiai ua houtuafare kekahi i kēia mea hana no ka helu ʻana i te mau pōmaikaʻi a me te mau hopena, ua haʻi mai koʻu intuition iaʻu he mea hou aʻe ia e aʻo mai ai iā mātou e pili ana i ke kumu o kā mātou hana ʻana i loko.",
    "page.about.p.my-first-clue-was-the-four": "ʻO kaʻu ʻike mua ʻo ia te mau ʻāpana ʻehā: ka Makahiki, Mahina, Lā, a me ka hola. Pono kēia mau mea e like me ko mātou ʻuhane, noʻonoʻo, naʻau, a me ke kino! Ua hana au i ka helu ʻana, akā aia kekahi mea. Ua like ka hapa o luna o ka ʻike me ka matahiti a me ka ʻavaʻe, akā ʻo ka hapa lalo me ka lā a me ka hola ʻaʻole like me ka laina me te mau ʻike o ka poʻe e kū pono ana i mua oʻu. Ua hoʻopaʻa wau me ia no te mau matahiti ma mua o ka ʻike ʻana mai iaʻu: ʻO ka ʻEhā Pillars System ke koi nei i kona kuleana hānau mai ka Jade Emperor, ma kekahi mau kuʻuna i hāʻawi pololei ʻia mai ka Buddha ponoʻī.",
    "page.about.p.since-the-buddha-s-traditional-birthplac": "No ka mea aia ma Nepal ka wahi hānau kuʻuna o Buddha, ua hoʻoholo wau e hoʻomaka i ka hoʻololi ʻana i te mau manawa hānau o te mau poʻe i ka palena manawa Nepalese ma mua o ka hoʻohui ʻana i kā lākou ʻike i ka ʻEhā Pillars Calculator - a hiki koke, voilà! Hoʻopili hope kēia ʻikepili hānau hou i te mau mea a pau. No laila, i kēia manawa ma kā mātou pūnaewele, hana ka <a href=\"calculator.html\">Totem Calculator</a> i te mau mea a pau iā ʻoe: e hoʻopili wale i kou lā hānau, manawa, a me kou wahi, a ua hoʻokomo ʻia ka hoʻololi ma mua o ka puka ʻana o kāu mau animala ʻehā. ʻĀnō, ʻo ka mea āu e ʻike ai e pili pono ana me kou ʻuhane, noʻonoʻo, naʻau, a me ke kino!",
    "page.about.h3.philosophy": "Filosofi",
    "page.about.p.i-like-to-think-of-these": "Makemake au e noʻonoʻo i kēia mau animala ʻehā e like me te mau kāleka i hāʻawi ʻia iā ʻoe i ka hoʻomaka ʻana o kēia ola. Ua kūkulu ʻia lākou ma laila mai ka hoʻomaka ʻana e pono ai ʻoe, akā ʻaʻole lākou e sila iki i kou hopena. Loaʻa iā ʻoe ka manawa kūpono e hana ai iā lākou a hoʻomaʻemaʻe iā lākou, a i ʻole e mālama ʻole iā lākou a bluff i kekahi manawa ite mau makemake ʻoe! Akā, he mea kōkua ia e ʻike i kāu mea e pāʻani nei no ka mea ke neʻe nei ka pāʻani.",
    "page.about.p.a-central-tenet-of-totem-astrology": "ʻO ka manaʻo koʻikoʻi o Totem Astrology ka manaʻolana - manaʻolana no ka ʻite maikaʻi ʻana iā ʻoe iho, manaʻolana e ʻite maikaʻi i kāu mau hoa pili a me te mau lālā o ka utuafare, a me ka manaʻolana aia kekahi, a i ʻole kekahi, ma waho e kūlike me ʻoe e like me kou ʻano. Hāʻawi te mau aratai ʻehā iā mātou i kahi ʻano ʻōlelo kaʻana like: kahi mea ʻokoʻa e hōʻailona i ka mea e hana nei no mātou i loko, no laila hiki iā mātou ke kamaʻilio e pili ana i kā mātou ʻokoʻa me ka ʻole o kēlā me kēia kamaʻilio e lilo i hoʻokolokolo.",
    "page.about.p.this-is-not-an-excuse-for": "ʻAʻole kēia he kumu no ka hana ʻino, ʻaʻole hoʻi he kumu e ʻae ai i ka hana ʻino a kekahi. He mea hana ia no ka ʻite ʻana i kekahi i kekahi a hāʻawi i kekahi i kekahi i ka lokomaikaʻi - ka lokomaikaʻi i hānau ʻia mai ka ʻite ʻana i ko mātou ʻokoʻa a me ka mahalo i te mau ʻano ʻano like ʻole o ka poʻe e hana ai i loko. Ke ʻike mātou i ka hiki ʻana mai o ka lohi o ka mea aloha i hui pū ʻia me ka noʻonoʻo moeʻuhane a ka Cat a i ʻole ka Deer, a i ʻole ka mākaukau o ka Tiga a Lio paha e hoʻomaka i ka hana, e loaʻa iā mātou te mau puka makani i te mau mea e hiki mai ana i loko - mau me ka pahuhopu o ka hoʻoponopono ʻana i ko mātou mau hemahema o loko a me ka lokomaikaʻi i te mau hemahema o kekahi, ʻaʻole e kala i ka pōʻino.",
    "page.about.p.everybody-else-has-their-own-four": "Loaʻa i te mau taata ʻē aʻe kā lākou mau animala ponoʻī ʻehā, a hiki ke kōkua i ka ʻike i ka mea a mātou e hana nei i hiki iā mātou ke ʻite maikaʻi kekahi i kekahi a hauʻoli i kā mātou ʻokoʻa ma mua o ka hakakā ʻana ma luna o lākou. He ʻokoʻa ka ikaika o te mau animala like ʻole a lawe kēlā me kēia totem i kona akamai ponoʻī.",
    "page.about.section-label.the-system": "Te ʻōpuʻaraʻa",
    "page.about.h2.spirit-mind-heart-body": "Vārua, Manaʻo, ʻĀʻau & Tino",
    "page.about.p.each-pillar-of-your-totem-pole": "Hōʻike kēlā me kēia pou o kāu pou totem i hoʻokahi aratai animala totem - he hōʻailona ola no kēlā ʻāpana o ʻoe.",
    "page.about.h3.year-spirit": "Matahiti · Vārua",
    "page.about.p.this-animal-speaks-to-us-in": "Ke kamaʻilio nei kēia animala iā mātou ma ka ʻōlelo o ka intuition.",
