    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six": "Kū'ē ma ka huila zodiac - ʻeono hōʻailona kaʻawale, e kū pono ana kekahi i kekahi ma ka pōʻai. He kūpono no ka noʻonoʻo ʻana i te mau makapō a me ke aʻo ʻana mai kahi ʻano ʻokoʻa.",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six.2": "Kū'ē ma ka huila zodiac - ʻeono hōʻailona kaʻawale, e kū pono ana kekahi i kekahi ma ka pōʻai. He kūpono kēia mau pilina no ka noʻonoʻo ʻana iā mātou iho a me ka ʻike ʻana i te mau maka maka o kekahi - ʻoiai ke alo maoli nei lākou i ka ʻaoʻao ʻē aʻe ʻo ʻoe! Hiki i kēia ke hana i te mau hoʻopaʻapaʻa wela, akā ite mau lōʻihi ʻoe e mahalo nui ai i ka papaʻaina, nui te mau mea e aʻo ai ma ʻaneʻi mai kāu mau aniani - hiki iā ʻolua ke ʻike i te mau mea ʻaʻole hiki i kekahi, no laila ke hilinaʻi ʻoe i kekahi i kekahi a hana me ka manaʻoʻiʻo maikaʻi, hiki ke lilo i mea kōkua maikaʻi a nani hoʻi. E mālama pono ana ia i te mau mea hoihoi, no ka mea, he ʻokoʻa ko lākou manaʻo i te mau mea ma mua o ʻoe, i kekahi manawa he ʻokoʻa loa ia ʻaʻole ʻoe i manaʻo he hiki!",
