    "page.connType.values-trine.section-label.connection-type": "Huru fāriʻiraʻa",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h1.values-trine": "Values Trine",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Waiwai kaʻana like — aia te mau animala ʻelua i ka Triangle Values ​​hoʻokahi, no laila ʻōlelo pinepine ʻoe i ka ʻōlelo like i ka wā e pili ana i te mau mea nui o ke ola.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Waiwai kaʻana like - aia te mau animala ʻelua i ka Triangle Values ​​like: Power & Prestige, Security & Stability, Inspiration & Idealism, a i ʻole Beace & Harmony. ʻO kēia mau pilina ka poʻe e ʻōlelo i ka ʻōlelo like me ʻoe, te mau waiwai-wise. Loaʻa iā lākou te mau mea nui e pili ana i ke ʻano o ka hele ʻana e pili ana i ke ola - ite mau paha ʻo ia ka ʻimi ʻana i ka mana a me ka hana hana i kahi kālepa, a i ʻole ka ʻimi ʻana i ka maluhia a me ke ʻano maʻalahi. He poʻe kēia ʻaʻole pono ʻoe e wehewehe pinepine iā ʻoe iho, no ka mea aia lākou ma ka ʻaoʻao like me ʻoe, no laila hiki ke maikaʻi no kēlā me kēia ʻano pilina: ʻoihana a leʻaleʻa paha, utuafare a i ʻole hoaloha. Ka holo mālie :)",
