    "page.connType.same-as-me.section-label.connection-type": "Huru fāriʻiraʻa",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.h1.same-as-me": "Same-As-Me",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the": "ʻO ka animala totem hoʻokahi ma ka pou hoʻokahi - a i ʻole ka animala hoʻokahi i kahi \"ring\" ʻokoʻa i hānau ʻia he 12, 24, a i ʻole 36 mau matahiti ke kaʻawale. Te mau aratai like; kanaka okoa kupanaha.",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the.2": "ʻO ka animala totem like ma ka pae hoʻokahi - ʻo kekahi e kaʻana like i kāu aratai ʻuhane, noʻonoʻo, naʻau, a i ʻole kino. Hiki iā ia ke poʻe mai te mau 'rings' like ʻole - ʻo ia hoʻi ka poʻe i hānau ʻia 12, 24, 36, a i ʻole kekahi mau matahiti he 12 kaʻawale mai ʻoe. No ka laʻana, he Tiger Fire wau i hānau ʻia i ka matahiti 1986, akā loaʻa iaʻu kekahi utuafare Tiger maikaʻi loa a me te mau hoaaloha i hānau ʻia ma te mau Tiger rings ʻokoʻa - ʻo kekahi o koʻu mau ʻanakala he Tiger Water i hānau ʻia i ka matahiti 1962, ʻo kaʻu keiki he Tiger Metal i hānau ʻia i ka matahiti 2010, a he mau hoa aloha, te mau haumāna, a me te mau hoa aloha ʻo Earth Tigers i hānau ʻia i ka matahiti 1998. Hiki ke ʻoluʻolu ke ʻike i ke ʻano o kāu mau animala ke loaʻa iā lākou te mau mea ʻono ʻokoʻa e hoʻoili ana i ko lākou ikehu i te mau poʻe ʻē aʻe. Hiki ke maʻalahi ka loaʻa ʻana o ka poʻe i hānau ʻia ma ka lā hānau like me ʻoe, no laila ua loaʻa iā lākou te mau aratai animala like ʻole, a i ʻole 3 ma kahi o 4 ite mau ʻokoʻa ka animala hola, a e ʻike pehea lākou i koho ai e pāʻani i ko lākou lima ma mua o ke ʻano āu i koho ai e pāʻani i kāu - ʻano like me ka ʻokoʻa o te mau māhoe 'like' ma te mau ʻano he nui, akā kaʻana like i te mau mea he nui. He mea mana ka makemake kūʻokoʻa, a hōʻike maopopo loa kēia pili. He like te mau animala hānau e aratai ana iā lākou, akā ʻokoʻa ka poʻe i aratai ʻia a ʻokoʻa hoʻi :)",
