    "home.p.we-ll-confirm-details-and-book": "Matou te faʻamaonia auiliiliga ma tusi se sauniga vitio i se taimi e galue mo oe.",
    "home.h3.your-session": "Lau Sauniga",
    "home.p.a-focused-conversational-reading-tailore": "O se faitau talanoa e faʻatatau i au fesili — ua puʻeina mo oe e toe vaʻai.",
    "home.h3.integration": "Tuʻufaʻatasia",
    "home.p.receive-a-written-summary-and-optional": "E te mauaina se aotelega tusitusia ma le mulimuli filifilia e faʻaloloto lau malamalama i le taimi.",
