    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Fa'atatau au manu totem e fa, ona su'esu'e lea i le lisi o le opt-in directory mo tagata e fa'asoa lenei ituaiga feso'ota'iga ma oe.",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Lisi Totem Connections",
