    "page.connType.values-trine.section-label.connection-type": "Ituaiga Fesootaiga",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h1.values-trine": "Values Trine",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Tau fa'asoa — o manu uma e tasi e tasi le Tatolu Fa'atauga, o lea e masani ona e tautala i le gagana e tasi pe a o'o i mea e fa'amuamua o le olaga.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Tau fa'asoa - o manu uma e lua e tutusa Tulaga Tafatolu: Malosi & Fa'ailoga, Saogalemu & Mausalī, Fa'aosofiaga & Manatu, po'o le Filemu & Fa'atasi. O nei feso'ota'iga o tagata e tautala i le gagana lava e tasi e pei o oe, fa'atauaina. E tutusa o latou faamuamua pe a oo i le auala e feagai ai ma le olaga - pe o le tulituliloaina lea o le pule ma le faiva alofilima i se fefaʻatauaʻiga, poʻo le sailia o le filemu ma se olaga faʻafaigofie. O tagata ia e te le tau fa'amatala soo i ai oe, aua o lo'o i ai i latou i luga o le itulau e tasi ma oe, e mafai ona lelei mo so'o se ituaiga mafutaga: pisinisi po'o fiafia, aiga po'o faauoga. Manuia tamo'e :)",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h3.other-connection-types": "Isi ituaiga fesootaiga",
    "page.connType.values-trine.li.rainbow": "<a href=\"connection-rainbow.html?v=20260807\">Nuanua</a>",
